  "changelog": [
    {
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "date": "2026-11-21",
      "highlights": [
        "Added all 4 WV Left-Sidebar Extensions with custom vector icons: WV Antigravity (Rainbow 'A'), WV Skills (Skills Sparkle), WV Preview (Magnifying Glass), and WV Chatski (Chat Bubble).",
        "Adopted the unified AI Inbox look & feel across WV Antigravity and WV Skills with live hoverable token consumption telemetry (in | out | thinking) on every panel.",
        "Expanded from 28 to 40 skills while keeping the dedicated WV State Skills category (WV FOIA \u00a7 29B-1-4, WV Sovereign Immunity & Purchasing \u00a7 5A-3, Legislative Audit).",
        "Enforced strict WVOT Zero-Footprint laptop standards: 100% self-contained storage inside ~/.gemini/config/, BOM-free PowerShell 5.1 JSON handling, offline Noto Emoji PNG fallbacks, opt-in disabled automations, and 1-command clean uninstallers."
      ]
    }
  ],
